(escaped: sys._getframe, a traceback, gi_frame) is a node of its own (py-final-1126: asyncio's debug mode"] [1188 1 "// takes a coroutine's frame for a future's source traceback), held by the generator's edge and by what else holds it:"] [1189 1 "// a holder outside the graph keeps it, and what it reaches, alive, as Go sees it."] [1194 1 "// cyAllRefs makes cyTraverse list every object a slot holds, not only nodes (the shutdown's walk, exitRefs: queue 253)."] [1199 1 "// cyForced are the dictionaries an exit collection gives as dead (queue 253, pylifecycle.go): seeds of the graph,"] [1200 1 "// probed, never held, an edge into one reaching nothing; cyForcedSeeds the same as objects; cyWeakAlive, when set,"] [1201 1 "// tells whether a weak reference to the trash is outside it (its callback called)."] [1208 1 "// cyVisit is cyTraverse's visitor: a slot of the node, its kind (typed: a pointer of a concrete type, else an Object)"] [1209 1 "// and the node it holds."] [1212 1 "// cyTraverse is tp_traverse (queue 241; doc/python/PYTHON-SURVEY.md, \"Design: 241\"): f called with each slot of o (a"] [1213 1 "// node) that holds a node. Only slots o owns alone are listed: a backing array shared with another holder would hide"] [1214 1 "// that holder's reference. A reference the table does not list (a map's, a closure's, a field of a struct that is no"] [1215 1 "// object) stays visible to Go's collector, which only keeps more alive."] [1289 2 "// ioDictP is an _io object's dict (iobase's tp_dictoffset), walked as an instance's (queue 545)"] [1304 20 "// handed out as an object: a node of its own (queue 241)"] [1311 36 "// _thread._local's (local_traverse): its arguments and every thread's dict"] [1317 31 "// _asyncio's Future or Task: the slots of a task's cycle (queue 224)"] [1345 18 "// a dict subclass's instance it is the __dict__ of (py-final-1126: test_cycle_through_dict)"] [1458 3 "// a class (py-odict-1125): its namespace, bases, MRO (itself first) and metaclass; it